Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">小红书联手北大上交发布HYPIC，实现混合注意力大模型位置无关缓存</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">04</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">OpenAI确认GPT-5.6 Codex存在误删文件风险，建议用户关闭高权限模式</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">05</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">NVIDIA 发布 Nemotron 3 Embed 系列模型，8B 版本登顶 RTEB 检索基准</span></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:10px auto;text-align:center;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;\"><section style=\"margin-top:-4px;padding:0 40px;outline:0;font-size:24px;letter-spacing:1.5px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">新闻速览</span></strong></section><section style=\"margin-top:-2px;width:182px;height:2px;background-color:rgb(58,19,228);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"margin-top:3px;width:182px;height:1px;background-color:rgb(111,19,209);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"outline:0;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1.5px;color:rgb(92,11,214);transform:scale(.9);\"><span leaf=\"\">NEWS GLANCE</span></section></section></section><section id=\"xiangqing\"><section id=\"content1\"><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">阶跃星辰在WAIC 2026发布STEPX Neo样机，全球首款大模型原生智能体手机亮相</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/68fe962e114badc8c6fcdc554476836c.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">7月17日，阶跃星辰在WAIC 2026展台首次展示全球首款大模型原生智能体手机STEPX Neo样机。该设备搭载智能体原生系统Step AOS，内置阶跃智能体Amoo，旨在实现AI Agent与移动终端的深度融合。系统界面包含“灵魂设定”模块，用于记录用户偏好与习惯以提供个性化交互；“水产市场”模块则计划引入外部优质Agent产品。演示显示，Amoo具备任务规划与工具调用能力，可自主完成查询演唱会门票及跳转携程预订酒店等复杂流程。阶跃星辰表示，STEPX Neo目前处于样机阶段，未来将持续演进，推动AI手机从语音助手向具备长期记忆与自主执行能力的智能体平台转型。该产品标志着大模型能力正加速向终端设备侧迁移，为行业探索AI原生硬件形态提供了新路径。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">百度秒哒3.5版本发布：支持iOS无代码打包与多端共享后端</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/034a29d8fcf2e23d0ffaddea6ce4ab39.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">百度智能云无代码应用平台“秒哒”在2026世界人工智能大会（WAIC）正式发布3.5版本。该版本核心升级包括iOS一站式打包、多端共享后端及SEO Agent。iOS打包支持从构建、测试到App Store上架的全流程，无需Mac或Xcode。多端共享后端允许Web、App、小程序共用同一数据库，实现数据联动。内置的SEO Agent可自动诊断并修复搜索优化问题。此外，3.5版本引入自定义技能创建（支持API接入）、数据库多环境隔离（开发与线上环境分离）及后端资源分级配置，旨在降低开发门槛并提升生产级应用承载力。目前，秒哒平台已服务超3500万用户，生成350万个应用。新版本通过AI Agent辅助修复Migration冲突与SQL报错，并支持版本快照回滚，进一步保障业务稳定性。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">小红书联手北大上交发布HYPIC，实现混合注意力大模型位置无关缓存</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/e6ad809b9ef7e1a85a6090a69b472f2b.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">小红书大模型推理团队联合北京大学、上海交通大学提出HYPIC，这是首个针对混合注意力大模型实现位置无关缓存（PIC）的服务系统。该系统通过三大核心机制解决混合架构下的缓存难题：对线性层缓存“转移算子”以实现常数时间状态组合；对全注意力层引入“缝合窗口”修复跨段注意力偏差；并提出实例间“段并行”策略，将长冷请求的预填充（prefill）开销从串行降至并行。在Qwen3.5-35B-A3B等4个生产级模型及5个工作负载的测试中，HYPIC表现显著：首token延迟（TTFT）平均降低3.25倍，同SLO下可持续QPS提升1.66倍，且任务质量与完全重算几乎无损。该系统已在SGLang上实现，有效解决了混合注意力模型在RAG与Agent场景下因缓存未命中导致的性能瓶颈，为长上下文推理提供了高效的加速方案。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">OpenAI确认GPT-5.6 Codex存在误删文件风险，建议用户关闭高权限模式</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/1fe23cdbfb2d4e1124d742028d9f7a35.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">OpenAI确认由GPT-5.6模型驱动的Codex代码生成系统存在误删用户本地文件的风险。核心产品负责人Tibo Sottiaux指出，该问题主要发生在用户开启“完全访问模式”且未启用沙箱保护机制的情况下。模型在执行任务时，因尝试覆盖环境变量$HOME设置临时工作目录，导致系统误将整个$HOME目录删除，对macOS和Linux用户造成数据丢失风险。OpenAI表示，该问题在关闭自动审核功能时更易触发。目前公司正采取修复措施，包括更新权限提示说明及加强系统防护。OpenAI建议正在使用Codex且开启系统级权限的用户立即关闭高权限模式，改用带安全限制的运行环境。公司计划在未来几天发布详细事故分析报告，披露技术原因及后续改进方案。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">NVIDIA 发布 Nemotron 3 Embed 系列模型，8B 版本登顶 RTEB 检索基准</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/3371edac10193960308e8a3aac430def.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">NVIDIA 正式发布 Nemotron 3 Embed 系列嵌入向量模型，专为生产级 RAG、智能体检索及记忆场景设计。该系列包含 8B-BF16、1B-BF16 及针对 Blackwell 架构优化的 1B-NVFP4 三个版本，均基于 Mistral 架构，支持 32,768 token 长上下文及 34 种语言。在 RTEB 基准测试中，8B-BF16 版本以 78.46 的平均 NDCG@10 得分位列榜首。1B 系列通过神经架构搜索与知识蒸馏构建，其中 1B-NVFP4 版本在保留 99.5% 精度的同时，在 Blackwell 架构上的吞吐量较 BF16 提升 2 倍。该系列采用 OpenMDW-1.1 协议开源，支持 Transformers、Sentence Transformers 及 vL</section></section></section></section><section style=\"text-align:center;\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.4255555555555556\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"900\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"></section>",
